
### SRP-1

Selecting one section carries that section and nothing else in its document.

```console
$ pf -o - 'modes/plan.md#outcomes'
# Plan Mode

Follow [Outcomes](#outcomes). The other sections are material that procedure references.

## Outcomes

- A scoped plan.
W_ENTRY_DESTINATION: the entry reference 'Outcomes' resolves to the destination 'outcomes', which the bundle's entry line links it to
  reference: Outcomes
  resolved: outcomes

[exit 0]
```

### SRP-2

An unrelated sibling added to the same group leaves the bundle byte-identical. No output below is the observation.

```console
$ diff plan-before.bundle.md plan-after.bundle.md

[exit 0: diff, not pf — 0 means the files agree]
```

### SRP-3

A fragment naming a bullet's text resolves to nothing, so a bullet is not an addressable unit.

```console
$ pf -o - 'rules/bullets.md#prefer-plain-words'
